Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-pip, python3-pyte, python3-paramiko, picocom, beep, mtr | mtr-tiny, snmp, iw, network-manager, traceroute, whois, iperf3, nmap, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: nodejs, npm
Description: Modern graphical interface for network management
 Omnicom is a modern and elegant graphical interface for network device
 management, supporting Serial, SSH, Telnet, TFTP, IP Scanner, SNMP,
 Traceroute, Vulnerability Scanning and Speed Testing.
 .
 Features:
  - Serial communication via picocom with automatic port detection
  - SSH and Telnet remote connections with profile management
  - Built-in TFTP server
  - IP Scanner with ARP and hostname resolution
  - SNMP browser
  - Traceroute / MTR with graphical visualization
  - Vulnerability Scanner using Nmap and NVD CVE database
  - Speed Test via iPerf3 or fast.com (Netflix CDN)
  - Modern PyQt6 interface
